  "name": "ThemeMarketingSimpleScreen",
  "kind": "composed",
  "docs": "The simple line: blocks with one content model each (hero@1, split@1, team@1, intro@1, gallery@1, features@1, stats@1, stories@1, photos@1, testimonials@1, logos@1, faq@1, steps@1), the same content in every variant. A home page with the hero, the features, the team, the stats, the steps, the quotes and the questions, and a team page with the wide hero, the team on cards, the gallery, the photos and the stories; a blog page (the article lead, the article, a figure, a pull quote, chapters, topics), a shop page (collections, products, one product, choices, specs, compare, purchase, reviews, store policies), a pricing page (the showcase, the rating, pricing, offers, a course outline, contacts, locations) and an about page (the header, an event and a profile intro, the team list, the error block, the footer). A venue page shows the food, stays and local services blocks (menu@1 and the rest of wave 3).",
